 meal a week. Life without pizza on the weekend would be unendurable for some people. One alcoholic beverage (a beer, glass of wine, or a drink) once a week at mealtime is fine. Any eating plan will fail if  it  is  too rigid.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":550.09,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":37.0,"r":178.00999999999996,"t":739.14},"charspan":[0,472],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/0","text":"No use being a zealot. A couple of teaspoons of sugar on your morning oatmeal or cereal, and beans or greens cooked in a small amount of bacon or ham won't wreck your routine. Eat just about anything you want or crave (reasonable amounts) for one meal a week. Life without pizza on the weekend would be unendurable for some people. One alcoholic beverage (a beer, glass of wine, or a drink) once a week at mealtime is fine. Any eating plan will fail if  it  is  too rigid."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Size","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":526.656,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":37.0,"r":60.05200000000001,"t":536.508},"charspan":[0,4],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/1","text":"Size"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"You have nothing to lose but fat,  and  some sizes in your belt and clothes.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":478.09,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":37.0,"r":178.01099999999994,"t":511.14},"charspan":[0,76],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/2","text":"You have nothing to lose but fat,  and  some sizes in your belt and clothes."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"section_header","level":1,"orig":"Timing","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":454.656,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":37.0,"r":77.236,"t":464.508},"charspan":[0,6],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/3","text":"Timing"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Is  this  your  time  for  blubber elimination? King Solomon wrote of the proper time for everything under the sun: a time to sow and a time to reap, a time to live and a time to die-and so on. No one will decide to lose fat (or stop being an alcoholic) until the proper time is reached-for him or  her.  For  people  who  are  tortured by being overweight, the time just might be right now.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":298.09,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":37.0,"r":178.0110000000001,"t":439.14},"charspan":[0,391],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/4","text":"Is  this  your  time  for  blubber elimination? King Solomon wrote of the proper time for everything under the sun: a time to sow and a time to reap, a time to live and a time to die-and so on. No one will decide to lose fat (or stop being an alcoholic) until the proper time is reached-for him or  her.  For  people  who  are  tortured by being overweight, the time just might be right now."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Yours for good health and safe flying","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":274.0899999999999,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":37.00099999999999,"r":177.99300000000014,"t":295.14},"charspan":[0,37],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/5","text":"Yours for good health and safe flying"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"Dr. Stoutt is a partner in the Springs Pediatrics and Aviation Medicine Clinic, Louisville, Ky., and he has been an active AME since 1960. No longer an active pilot,  he  holds  a  commercial pilot's certificate with instrument, multi-engine, and CFI ratings.","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":166.09000000000003,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":37.00099999999999,"r":178.0140000000001,"t":259.14},"charspan":[0,259],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/6","text":"Dr. Stoutt is a partner in the Springs Pediatrics and Aviation Medicine Clinic, Louisville, Ky., and he has been an active AME since 1960. No longer an active pilot,  he  holds  a  commercial pilot's certific